## 🚀 デプロイメント

### 本番環境用Docker Compose
```yaml
# compose.prod.yml
services:
  backend:
    build:
      context: ./backend
      target: production
    environment:
      - PORT=8080
      - PROXMOX_API_URL=${PROXMOX_API_URL}
      - PROXMOX_API_TOKEN=${PROXMOX_API_TOKEN}
    restart: unless-stopped

  frontend:
    build:
      context: ./frontend
      target: production
    environment:
      - NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=${NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL}
    restart: unless-stopped
```

### 環境変数管理
```bash
# 本番環境用環境変数
export PROXMOX_API_URL="https://your-proxmox-server:8006"
export PROXMOX_API_TOKEN="your-secure-api-token"
export NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL="https://your-domain.com/api"
```

